 vie, elle se raconte qu’elle devrait plutôt vivre la vie de son père.\r Elle s’habille désormais comme lui, parle comme lui, respire comme lui et elle le fait avec une telle force qu’autour d’elle, les autres finissent par y croire et se mettent à l’appeler « Marcello »."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4PkwEzagOOgst6x8cFZqfn4FlXk.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/aCA4sHUWU8qaGXCw3TVD2qzzQXW.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":1145608,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"fr-FR","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4PkwEzagOOgst6x8cFZqfn4FlXk.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4PkwEzagOOgst6x8cFZqfn4FlXk.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4PkwEzagOOgst6x8cFZqfn4FlXk.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4PkwEzagOOgst6x8cFZqfn4FlXk.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9etOAmlGnVtxGFXNCi9M7eTwaz2.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9etOAmlGnVtxGFXNCi9M7eTwaz2.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":2800}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gr3oOAUYR4ttdYPfd1Nr9bUMCf5.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/gr3oOAUYR4ttdYPfd1Nr9bUMCf5.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gr3oOAUYR4ttdYPfd1Nr9bUMCf5.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/gr3oOAUYR4ttdYPfd1Nr9bUMCf5.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wukvcfa4OFTPHx7WIRUFMDwDCZX.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/wukvcfa4OFTPHx7WIRUFMDwDC